&lt;/a&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ref right&quot; style=&quot;padding: 0 0 3px 3px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Bois de chauffage&quot; href=&quot;#Bois de chauffage&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/images/pathfinder/wiki/logoref.png&quot; width=&quot;12px&quot; style=&quot;opacity:0.1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;separator&quot;&gt;Bois de chauffage (par jour)&lt;a class=&quot;headeranchor&quot; id=&quot;Bois_de_chauffage_par_jour_18&quot; href=&quot;#Bois_de_chauffage_par_jour_18&quot; title=&quot;Link to this Section&quot; style=&quot;visibility: hidden;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;b&gt;Prix&lt;/b&gt; 1 pc ; &lt;b&gt;Poids&lt;/b&gt; 10 kg  
&lt;hr&gt;
Ce paquet de bois sec se compose de brindilles ou de b&#251;ches.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;/Wiki/Pathfinder-RPG.Armes et &#233;quipement (Contenu).ashx&quot; style=&quot;float:right; padding: 4px 4px 2px 8px;&quot;&gt;
